  "description": "Original composition: Crystalline Dreams\n\nConcept: Floating, ethereal soundscape with shimmering cascades\n\nFeatures:\n- Ab Lydian mode (#4) for bright, dreamy quality\n- Electric piano for bell-like clarity\n- Custom floating cascade arpeggio (16-step pattern)\n- Bass arpeggio (1-5-3-5) creates gentle pulse\n- Keep parameter sustains upper notes (crystalline effect)\n- Extended 9th chords for lush harmony\n- Cathedral reverb + long echo for space\n- Varied lengths (1-8 bars) for organic flow\n- Opens with 6-bar maj9, closes with 8-bar maj9\n- 48 bpm = meditative, spacious tempo\n- Sus chords create smooth transitions\n- Spread + high octave = shimmering texture\n\nMood: Contemplative, peaceful, otherworldly\n",
